{"3721680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shatterland", "steam_appid": 3721680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7dddf540dee0a494a89d1643243ee890.avif?t=1765831032\" width=610 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🚨<strong>You can also get the game at a lower price on our new store</strong>🚨<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/402401f0c8c7453a4bf172544ce17727.webp?t=1765831032\" width=335 height=24 /></span> <br>... <strong>Created By A Solo Developer ...</strong> <br><br><strong>Shatterland</strong> blends survival, exploration, and story-driven mystery.  <br>Uncover memory fragments, craft your base, and fight back against your brother’s infected army to reclaim the world that was once yours.  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>..STORY..<br>In this world, only two clones remain  you and your brother. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> But your brother has lost his mind. Consumed by rage, he destroyed the laboratory, killed everyone who created you... and left you alive.  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now he hunts you across the ruins of a shattered Earth. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> To survive, you must grow stronger  explore the world, recover fragments of your lost memory, and unlock your hidden powers.  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every step brings you closer to the final confrontation.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- ⚠️ IMPORTANT INFORMATION</strong> <strong>-</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 💾 <strong>Automatic Saving</strong> – The game saves itself automatically. There is no manual save or multiple save slots — progress is stored continuously, just like in an online world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🎮 <strong>Partial Controller Support</strong> – Some parts of the game work with controllers, but full controller support is still in development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ⏸️ <strong>No Pause System</strong> – Because the game is always online, pausing does not stop the world. Enemies can still attack, and events continue in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🌐 <strong>Online-Only Co-op</strong> – Friends can join your session at any time to help you survive. The difficulty is shared it’s easier with teammates, but deadly alone. (you can play without internet to it will save the game on your pc).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ⚔️ <strong>Rescue &amp; Power-Leveling</strong> – If you die, your friends can join your world, pick up weapons, and help you recover. You can also join their world to gain levels faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🔒 <strong>World-Based Inventory</strong> – Your items stay in the world you’re playing in. When joining another player’s session, you start with a fresh inventory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shatterland is built to feel alive a world that never truly stops, even when you do.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>.Last Pulse Studio.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">..We Make Simple and Fun Games..</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/cf55027e14e6b97deb167ad42015a8e9.avif?t=1765831032\" width=1552 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/aff6c9aea73424ec5e38731428416f82.avif?t=1765831032\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 Uncover Your Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a secret lab, recover lost files, and piece together the truth along with fragments of your stolen powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/9f81f268daed7a68f277f3f7ccf10dbe.avif?t=1765831032\" width=610 height=88 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Open-World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a vast post-apocalyptic wasteland filled with zombies/alien, hostile survivors, and the remnants of the military that created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/2281e0270cdaf3d2b9e3f4b989fc94c1.avif?t=1765831032\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features in Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized Low-Poly World:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style that brings clarity and charm to your survival journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 <strong>Fight to Survive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle hordes of the Alien, hostile survivors, and twisted military experiments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ <strong>Quest System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on story-driven adventures and discover the secrets of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 <strong>Vehicle System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles to traverse the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up by surviving. Unlock new abilities and reclaim fragments of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏕️ <strong>Build &amp; Barricade:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create safe zones anywhere. Fortify your shelter and hold out against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌦️ <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing conditions where every hour brings new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 <strong>Survive Together</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barter with survivors, adjust difficulty, and tailor the experience to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and survival gear to improve your chances.<br><br><br>Last Pulse Studio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/402401f0c8c7453a4bf172544ce17727.webp?t=1765831032\" width=335 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/7dddf540dee0a494a89d1643243ee890.avif?t=1765831032\" width=610 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🚨<strong>You can also get the game at a lower price on our new store</strong>🚨<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/402401f0c8c7453a4bf172544ce17727.webp?t=1765831032\" width=335 height=24 /></span> <br>... <strong>Created By A Solo Developer ...</strong> <br><br><strong>Shatterland</strong> blends survival, exploration, and story-driven mystery.  <br>Uncover memory fragments, craft your base, and fight back against your brother’s infected army to reclaim the world that was once yours.  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------