raph\" >Explore the ruins of a secret lab, recover lost files, and piece together the truth along with fragments of your stolen powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/9f81f268daed7a68f277f3f7ccf10dbe.avif?t=1765831032\" width=610 height=88 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Open-World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a vast post-apocalyptic wasteland filled with zombies/alien, hostile survivors, and the remnants of the military that created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/2281e0270cdaf3d2b9e3f4b989fc94c1.avif?t=1765831032\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features in Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized Low-Poly World:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style that brings clarity and charm to your survival journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 <strong>Fight to Survive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle hordes of the Alien, hostile survivors, and twisted military experiments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ <strong>Quest System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on story-driven adventures and discover the secrets of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 <strong>Vehicle System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles to traverse the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up by surviving. Unlock new abilities and reclaim fragments of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.poster.avif?t=1765831032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.webm?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.mp4?t=1765831032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏕️ <strong>Build &amp; Barricade:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create safe zones anywhere. Fortify your shelter and hold out against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌦️ <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing conditions where every hour brings new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 <strong>Survive Together</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barter with survivors, adjust difficulty, and tailor the experience to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and survival gear to improve your chances.<br><br><br>Last Pulse Studio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/402401f0c8c7453a4bf172544ce17727.webp?t=1765831032\" width=335 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Shatterland is a co-op zombie/Alien survival game with base-building and exploration. Loot resources, craft weapons, build with friends, and fight through a devastated world filled with the undead, hostile survivors, and military secrets.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio s